Subject: [PATCH] Settings: add flashlight strength to Display

Opens the SystemUI flashlight strength dialog, the same one as a long
press on the flashlight tile. Only shown when SystemUI has a strength
property configured and the device has a flash.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
